          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಅವಲೋಕಿಸು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಲೋಕಿಸು — avalōkisu — \"to observe; to review\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರ್ಷದ ಕೊನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ಖರ್ಚನ್ನು ಅವಲೋಕಿಸಿದೆ. varṣada koneyalli nānu nanna kharcannu avalōkiside. At the end of the year I reviewed my spending."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಅವಲೋಕಿಸಿದೆ, avalōkiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಲೋಕನ, a review, an overview."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಲೋಕಿಸು (avalōkisu) is built on Sanskrit avalokana, \"seeing, viewing, observing\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
